*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : INT0030
*> PURPOSE : INTEREST TIERS RULES
*> AUTHOR  : A.W.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1992-07-12 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2009-12-09 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 651
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB INTNIGHT STEP040
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. INT0030.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 IN-RECORD.
    *> DEPOSIT TERM IN MONTHS
    05 TM-MM              PIC 9(3).
       88 TM-BAND-1-6 VALUE 1 THRU 6.
       88 TM-BAND-7-12 VALUE 7 THRU 12.
       88 TM-BAND-13-60 VALUE 13 THRU 60.
    05 PROC-DATE          PIC 9(8).
    05 PROC-DATE-R REDEFINES PROC-DATE.
       10 PROC-DATE-YYYY  PIC 9(4).
       10 PROC-DATE-MM    PIC 9(2).
       10 PROC-DATE-DD    PIC 9(2).
    05 FILLER             PIC X(4).
01 WS-OUT-REC.
    05 WS-IRT             PIC 9V9999 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
A000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT IN-RECORD
    PERFORM 3000-TERM-RATE
    DISPLAY "WS-IRT=" WS-IRT
    STOP RUN.
3000-TERM-RATE.
    EVALUATE TRUE
        WHEN TM-BAND-1-6
            MOVE 0.0275 TO WS-IRT
        WHEN TM-BAND-7-12
            MOVE 0.0350 TO WS-IRT
        WHEN TM-BAND-13-60
            MOVE 0.0425 TO WS-IRT
        WHEN OTHER
            MOVE 0.0150 TO WS-IRT
    END-EVALUATE.
